  nonce: '9440'  # 9440
  message: "PROGRESS (rows 2, 4, 5) on branch jgstern-agent/fix/audit0021-rows (local, not pushed), commit 38a2d7a731. Row 1 already fixed (4f463b6722). ROW 3 (python os.wait*) NOT TOUCHED -- left for WI-lanos's exit-status reconciliation; this item stays open for it. Row 2: objc removeObserver:/removeObserver:name:object: deleted from ipc_recv; swift NotificationCenter.removeObserver swept with them (same API); addObserver* untouched. Row 4: sqlite3.Connection.backup db_read -> db_write (returns None, writes the target), completeness note updated, class stays enumerated; corpus reach not measured (needs a typed receiver). Row 5: erlang ets:info / mnesia:table_info deleted from db_read (elixir inherits). Taint: untrusted_input sources gone (removeObserver x3, backup, ets.info/table_info in erlang+elixir); one database sink added (backup). A/B: removeObserver chains left ipc_recv on ResearchKit 33, AFNetworking 8, SDWebImage 8, Kingfisher 2, CocoaLumberjack 1; ets.info/table_info left db_read on vernemq 13, ejabberd 32, emqx 62, phoenix 1. Lost flows read (ejabberd dump_schema/dump_to_textfile, vernemq ets:info size to the query manager): all table metadata. No verdict moved toward confirmed. Report: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/decontend/run_10032026/ragaz.md (OUTCOME, draft CLOSURE NOTE, A/B artifacts in run_10032026/ragaz/). Tests: red then green on the board; branch affected-test run 9955 passed + 8 failed (7 were pins of the old rows, fixed in fdb14eb77e; 1 hypothesis health-check under load), re-run of those files 1138 passed. No status change made."  # 9440
